    title: "Receipt Tracking for Uber, DoorDash & Gig Workers Income and Expense Guide",
    description: "A full expense and receipt guide for gig workers: what to deduct, what proof to keep, and how to avoid leaving $500-$2,000 in deductions unclaimed.",
    featuredImage: "/landing/blog-gig-workers-income-expense-guide.webp?v=1",
    datePublished: "2026-04-17",
