  title: "How to Track Business Travel Expenses (And Actually Claim Everything You're Owed)",
  description:
    "Business travel has a way of generating expenses faster than you can track them. A cab to the airport. Breakfast at the hotel.",
  featuredImage: "/landing/blog-scan-receipts-for-tax-refund.webp?v=1",
